---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro';
import { u } from '../../../lib/paths';
---

<Base
  title="Add and drop in Spring Semester 2027"
  description="How continuing students add and drop courses for Spring Semester 2027, and when a petition is required."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Registration & records"
    title="Add and drop in Spring Semester 2027"
    lede="Continuing students register in MyUM. The spring term uses the same rules as the fall term."
    crumbs={[
      { href: '/support/', label: 'Student Support' },
      { href: '/support/articles/registration/', label: 'Registration' },
    ]}
  />
  <article class="prose wrap narrow">
    <p>
      Spring Semester 2027 instruction began Monday, January 4, 2027. You may change your schedule in MyUM until the
      add/drop deadline.
    </p>
    <p>
      The Spring Semester 2027 add/drop deadline is Friday, January 15, 2027. A course dropped by that day does not
      appear on the transcript. After the deadline, a drop is a withdrawal, shows as a W, and needs the college
      advisor’s approval.
    </p>
    <h2>Before you drop</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Aid for 2026–27 can change if you fall below the units in your award. Read the financial aid dates before you drop.</li>
      <li>International students and student athletes have a full-time unit minimum. Check with the advisor first.</li>
      <li>A waitlist seat is not an enrollment. You are enrolled only when the class is on your schedule.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Transcripts and enrollment letters</h2>
    <p>
      Order a transcript or an enrollment verification from MyUM under Records. Paper copies are ready in two business
      days at Enrollment Services, 140 Olympus Way. There is no charge for the first three official copies in an aid year.
    </p>
    <p>
      If MyUM will not let you enroll, submit a request and choose Registration &amp; records.
    </p>
    <p class="page-actions">
      <a class="btn" href={u('/support/?category=registration#request')}>Submit a registration request</a>
    </p>
    <p><a href={u('/academics/calendar/')}>Full academic calendar</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>
